<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria Feb crude oil output at 2.25 mln bpd.</title>
<headline>Nigeria Feb crude oil output at 2.25 mln bpd.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigerian crude oil production for February was 2.256 million barrels per day (bpd) compared with 2.348 million bpd in January, according to the monthly report of Ministry of Petroleum which was released Friday.</p>
<p>The report said this included condensate production from the Oso field operated by Mobil Corp.</p>
<p>Condensate production during the month in review was 98,947 barrels per (bpd), down from the January level of 101,435 bpd.</p>
<p>Total crude oil exports stood at 2.042,727 bpd, a decrease of 4.2 percent from January levels, the report said.</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 2630317</p>
</text>
